% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been tried with children. A JK classroom trial and an early-years music teacher must check that the class can echo right on the next downbeat with no rest, that the loud/soft and sung/clapped choices are clear to four-year-olds, and how Ella Jenkins is introduced; a second score reader must confirm the notation.
